+// Venetium 0041: hardware H.264 decoding for Windows systems whose ANGLE runs
+// on Direct3D 9 (no D3D11 device), e.g. Windows 10 ARM32 on NVIDIA Tegra 3/4.
+// D3D11VideoDecoder needs a D3D11 device from ANGLE, so on these systems every
+// codec fell back to software. This decoder is the D3D9 / Media Foundation path
+// of Chromium 77's DXVAVideoDecodeAccelerator (CMSH264DecoderMFT +
+// IDirect3DDeviceManager9 on ANGLE's own D3D9Ex device, StretchRect NV12->RGB
+// into a share-handle texture that ANGLE samples through an EGL pbuffer),
+// re-hosted on the media::VideoDecoder + SharedImage interfaces of this tree.
